+Show Configuration
+------------------
+
+To see the current application configuration, use the :func:`config <cli.config_command>`
+command. This will print the configuration as JSON. Values for keys containing
+SECRET, PASSWORD, TOKEN or KEY are masked as ``"***"``. ::
+
+    $ flask config
+    {
+      "DEBUG": false,
+      "SECRET_KEY": "***",
+      "TESTING": false
+    }
+
+
 Open a Shell
 ------------
 
